	<!-- Tutorials -->
	<string name="tutorial.intro.chapel">The Chapel lets you challenge the five Spirits for their powerful Boons. Each time the Spirit's trial is completed, its respective boon grows in power, but so does the difficulty of its future trials.</string>	

	<string name="tutorial.intro.pets">The selected Pet will accompany you on your adventures and help by picking gold and other collectibles. It can't be killed, so don't worry.</string>

	<string name="tutorial.intro.survival">To complete the trial and face the Spirit, accrue Spirit Favor by killing enough enemies before the timer runs out.</string>

